ITHUB IS unclechipaz \n9. yes its called streamwave\n10. lets get it to vercel\n\n# Previous Session Summary:\n# Continuation Summary\n\n## 1. Outstanding User Requests\n\n- **Deploy StreamWave Platform to Vercel**:\n  - *User Intent*: Push the codebase to GitHub (`unclechipaz/streamwave`) and deploy it to Vercel with working frontend pages and backend API endpoints.\n  - *Current Status*: **IMPLEMENTATION** (Pushed fixes for `vercel.json` routing. Next step: push `vercel.json` update to GitHub to verify live Vercel deployment at `https://streamwave-gamma.vercel.app`).\n  - *Sub-tasks*:\n    - Fix Vercel Edge CDN vs Python function routing in `vercel.json` so `/api/*` goes to `app.py` and static pages (`/`, `/checkout`, `/library`, CSS, JS, images, media) are served directly by Vercel CDN.\n\n- *Completed Requests Carried Forward & Resolved*:\n  - **Landing Page, Checkout Experience & Access Control**: Completed public landing page, EcoCash/Visa/MasterCard checkout simulation with success and decline test states, and signed cookie access control (Completed).\n  - **Netflix Logo Watermark Removal & Alignment**: Removed third-party Netflix watermark from Unsplash photo; added StreamWave logo watermark in CSS background; fixed text column alignment (Completed).\n  - **Vercel Build Error (`setuptools` auto-discovery crash)**: Fixed by adding `[tool.setuptools] py-modules = [\"app\"]` to `pyproject.toml` (Completed).\n  - **Vercel Runtime Crash (`FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED` 500 error)**: Fixed by wrapping filesystem asset creation helpers (`ensure_video_preview_asset`, `ensure_logo_asset`, `ensure_favicon_assets`) in safe `try...except` blocks to prevent crashes on Vercel's read-only file system (Completed).\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n\n- **Environment & GitHub Repository**:\n  - GitHub Username: `unclechipaz`\n  - GitHub Repository Name: `streamwave`\n  - GitHub Remote URL: `https://github.com/unclechipaz/streamwave.git`\n  - Active Vercel Deployment Domain: `streamwave-gamma.vercel.app`\n- **User Feedback & Errors Provided**:\n  - *\"im seeing netflix at the back there watermark like put streamwave\"* -> Resolved by replacing background image and adding CSS background watermark.\n  - *\"something went wrong the text is no longer aligned\"* -> Resolved by setting `.landing-hero` to `display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;`.\n  - *\"im satisfied lets push it to github enroute to vercel\"* -> Guided user through git commands.\n  - Vercel Build Error Screenshot: `error: Multiple top-level packages discovered in a flat layout ['data', 'public']` -> Resolved via `pyproject.toml`.\n  - Vercel 500 Screenshot: `Code: FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED` -> Resolved via `app.py` read-only filesystem try-except guards.\n  - Vercel 404 Screenshot: `{\"detail\":\"Landing page not found\"}` -> Resolved via `vercel.json` CDN routing.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n\n- **Vercel Static CDN & API Routing ([`vercel.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/vercel.json))**:\n  - Configured `vercel.json` to route `/api/(.*)`, `/docs`, `/redoc`, and `/openapi.json` to `app.py` (@vercel/python), while routing `/checkout` to `/checkout.html`, `/library` to `/library.html`, and all other static requests to Vercel's Global Edge CDN.\n- **Read-Only Serverless Safeguards ([`app.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/app.py))**:\n  - Wrapped `ensure_video_preview_asset()`, `ensure_logo_asset()`, and `ensure_favicon_assets()` in `try...except` blocks, suppressing `OSError` on Vercel's read-only `/var/task` runtime and fixing `FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED`.\n- **Setuptools Pyproject Discovery Fix ([`pyproject.toml`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/pyproject.toml))**:\n  - Added `[tool.setuptools] py-modules = [\"app\"]` to prevent setuptools from failing when scanning `public/` and `data/` directories.\n- **Landing Hero Watermark & Text Alignment ([`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html), [`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css))**:\n  - Removed stock photo containing third-party Netflix watermark.\n  - Added StreamWave brand logo watermark in CSS background.\n  - Ensured `.landing-hero` is a vertical flex column (`flex-direction: column`) with centered text.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n- **Vercel Routing Architecture**:\n  - Catch-all routes (`\"src\": \"/(.*)\", \"dest\": \"app.py\"`) redirect all static requests to Python. In Vercel serverless functions, static files inside `public/` are not bundled into the Python function zip by default, causing `FileResponse` 404s.\n  - The correct Vercel configuration routes `/api/(.*)` to `@vercel/python` and leaves static assets (`/`, `/checkout.html`, `/library.html`, CSS, JS, media) to Vercel's Edge CDN (`\"src\": \"/(.*)\", \"dest\": \"/$1\"`).\n- **Vercel Read-Only File System**:\n  - Serverless functions run in a read-only environment (`/var/task`). Top-level code executing `mkdir()` or `shutil.copyfile()` on `/var/task` will raise `OSError: [Errno 30] Read-only file system` and crash invocation. Wrap all asset sync helper functions in `try...except`.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited Files\n- [`vercel.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/vercel.json): Updated routes configuration to route `/api/*` to `app.py` and static files to Vercel Edge CDN.\n- [`app.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/app.py): Added `try...except` blocks around `ensure_video_preview_asset()`, `ensure_logo_asset()`, and `ensure_favicon_assets()`.\n- [`pyproject.toml`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/pyproject.toml): Added `[tool.setuptools] py-modules = [\"app\"]`.\n- [`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html): Cleaned up landing hero structure.\n- [`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css): Added CSS background logo watermark and vertical flex column alignment.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n\n- **Current State**: `vercel.json` has just been updated to separate API routes (`/api/*`) from Vercel Edge CDN static page routes (`/`, `/checkout`, `/library`).\n- **Immediate Next Steps**:\n  1. Instruct the user to push the updated `vercel.json` to GitHub:\n     ```cmd\n     git add vercel.json\n     git commit -m \"fix: Update vercel.json for Vercel CDN static routes and FastAPI endpoint routing\"\n     git push origin main\n     ```\n  2. Verify that `https://streamwave-gamma.vercel.app` loads the public landing page, allows checkout simulation (`/checkout`), sets the signed session cookie, and opens the member library (`/library`).\n\n**IMPORTANT: this summary is just for your reference. You may respond to my previous and future messages, but DO NOT ACKNOWLEDGE THIS CHECKPOINT MESSAGE. JUST READ IT BUT DO NOT MENTION IT, RESPOND TO IT, OR TAKE ACTION BECAUSE OF IT.**"}
