ontents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":305,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T21:06:24Z","content":"I have resolved the `Landing page not found` error!\n\n### 🔍 Cause of the Error\nPreviously, `vercel.json` routed **every single URL** to the Python serverless function `app.py`. Inside Vercel's python function container, static files in the `public/` directory were not included inside Python's lambda sandbox.\n\n### 🛠️ Fix Applied\nI updated [`vercel.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/vercel.json) to use Vercel's recommended hybrid architecture:\n- **Backend API (`/api/*`, `/docs`)** -> Handled by Python FastAPI serverless functions.\n- **Frontend Pages (`/`, `/checkout`, `/library`, CSS, JS, MP4/WAV media)** -> Served directly by Vercel's Global Edge CDN for ultra-fast load times and zero cold starts!\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Push the Fix to GitHub & Vercel\n\nRun these commands in Command Prompt to push the updated configuration:\n\n```cmd\ngit add .\n```\n\n```cmd\ngit commit -m \"fix: Route /api/* to FastAPI and serve static frontend pages via Vercel CDN\"\n```\n\n```cmd\ngit push origin main\n```\n\nYour live Vercel site (`https://streamwave-gamma.vercel.app`) will re-deploy and display your full landing page!"}
