{"step_index":311,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:37:50Z","thinking":"**Revising Vercel Config**\n\nI've just revised the `vercel.json` file. My focus is on updating the rewrites to align with modern Vercel conventions. The new rewrites map specific paths like `/checkout` and `/library` to their respective HTML files. I'm aiming for simplicity and clarity in the configuration.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"{\n  \"rewrites\": [\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/checkout\",\n      \"destination\": \"/checkout.html\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/library\",\n      \"destination\": \"/library.html\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/api/(.*)\",\n      \"destination\": \"/api/index.py\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/docs\",\n      \"destination\": \"/api/index.py\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/redoc\",\n      \"destination\": \"/api/index.py\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"/openapi.json\",\n      \"destination\": \"/api/index.py\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","Description":"Update vercel.json to use modern Vercel rewrites connecting /api/* to api/index.py and static files to CDN","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\vercel.json","toolAction":"Updating vercel.json","toolSummary":"Updating vercel.json"}}]}
