 Next Favourite,\" \"Enjoy It on Your Screen,\" and \"Safe, Simple Payments.\" I've finalized the accompanying descriptions: emphasizing local talent, searchability, responsive design, and secure transactions. Finally, I've defined the corresponding SVG icons as per the design requirements.\n\n\n**Defining the Code**\n\nI'm now integrating the generated SVG icons, the updated content, and the styling refinements. I've focused on the technical aspects within `public/index.html`. Specifically, I've incorporated the SVG markup for the \"Easy Ways to Access\" benefit card.  Also, I've verified the \"Zimbabwean Stories, Centre Stage,\" \"Find Your Next Favourite,\" and \"Enjoy It on Your Screen\" cards now have their content and icons, and that the call-to-action block and academic note are correctly placed within the structure.\n```\n\n**Styling the Section**\n\nI'm now diving into the CSS styling for the benefit cards and call-to-action block. I've defined the container style for the SVG icons, the `h3` and `p` styles, and the benefit card's overall styles. I'm focusing on the CTA block's appearance, including typography and button styles. I've also implemented responsiveness for smaller screens, optimizing the layout across devices. I've confirmed that the button link, which is currently `/checkout`, should go to either `/checkout` or `#start-form` depending on user authentication status. I will need to check `checkSession()` in `public/index.html`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>StreamWave Entertainment | Zimbabwe’s Stories, Music & Movies</title>\n    \n    <!-- Favicon Links -->\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">\n    <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\">\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/styles.css\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"landing-body\">\n    <!-- Header Navbar -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"/\" class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Entertainment Home\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"brand-logo-img\">\n            </a>\n\n            <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Primary Navigation\">\n                <a href=\"/docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"nav-link developer-link\" title=\"Open API Documentation\">\n                    Developer API <span class=\"ext-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"/library\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-signin-nav\" id=\"nav-signin-btn\">Sign In</a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Landing Section -->\n    <main class=\"landing-main\">\n        <!-- Full-Height Viewport Centered Hero Section with StreamWave Logo Background Watermark -->\n        <section class=\"landing-hero\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Membership Introduction\">\n            <div class=\"landing-hero-content\">\n                <div class=\"academic-badge-pill\">\n                    <span class=\"pulse-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span>Serverless Academic Prototype</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"landing-hero-title\">Zimbabwe’s stories, music and movies — all in one place.</h1>\n                <p class=\"landing-hero-subtitle\">Stream from US$2.99 per month. Cancel anytime.</p>\n                <p class=\"landing-hero-instruction\">Enter your email address to start your StreamWave membership.</p>\n\n                <form class=\"landing-start-form\" id=\"start-form\" onsubmit=\"handleStartMembership(event)\">\n                    <div class=\"input-action-group\">\n                        <label for=\"landing-email-input\" class=\"sr-only\">Email address</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" id=\"landing-email-input\" placeholder=\"Email address\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n                        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-get-started\">\n                            Get Started <span class=\"chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Refined Benefits Section: Entertainment That Feels Like Home -->\n        <section class=\"landing-section benefits-section\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Benefits\">\n            <div class=\"section-container\">\n                <h2 class=\"landing-section-title\">Entertainment That Feels Like Home</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Discover Zimbabwean films, music and creative stories in one beautifully simple streaming experience.</p>\n\n                <div class=\"benefits-grid\">\n                    <!-- Card 1 -->\n                    <article class=\"benefit-card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                            <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e50914\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"benefit-svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2.5\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"7\" y2=\"22\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"17\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"22\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"7\" y2=\"7\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"7\" y2=\"17\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"17\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"17\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"17\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"7\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3>Zimbabwean Stories, Centre Stage</h3>\n                        <p>Explore a curated collection of local films and music celebrating Zimbabwe’s established and emerging creative talent.</p>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <!-- Card 2 -->\n                    <article class=\"benefit-card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                            <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e50914\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"benefit-svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"21\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16.65\" y2=\"16.65\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"11\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"11\" y2=\"14\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"11\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3>Find Your Next Favourite</h3>\n                        <p>Search by title, artist or genre, preview films and sample tracks before deciding what to enjoy.</p>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <!-- Card 3 -->\n                    <article class=\"benefit-card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                            <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e50914\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"benefit-svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" rx=\"1.5\"/>\n                                <path d=\"M6 18h6\"/>\n                                <path d=\"M9 14v4\"/>\n                                <rect x=\"13\" y=\"8\" width=\"9\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1.5\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"16\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"18\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3>Enjoy It on Your Screen</h3>\n                        <p>Browse and play content through a responsive experience designed for smartphones, tablets and desktop computers.</p>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <!-- Card 4 -->\n                    <article class=\"benefit-card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-icon-container\">\n                            <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e50914\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"benefit-svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                                <rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"15\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3>Easy Ways to Access</h3>\n                        <p>Experience a simple subscription demonstration supporting EcoCash, Visa and Mastercard before entering the catalogue.</p>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Call to Action Block -->\n                <div class=\"benefits-cta-block text-center\">\n                    <h3 class=\"cta-title\">Ready to discover something new?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"cta-subtitle\">Explore StreamWave and experience Zimbabwean entertainment in one convenient destination.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/checkout\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-cta-benefits\" id=\"benefits-cta-btn\">Explore the Catalogue</a>\n                    <p class=\"academic-discreet-note\">Academic prototype: payment and subscription features are simulated, and no real financial transaction is processed.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- How It Works Section -->\n        <section class=\"landing-section how-it-works-section\" aria-label=\"How StreamWave Works\">\n            <div class=\"section-container\">\n                <h2 class=\"landing-section-title\">How It Works</h2>\n                <div class=\"steps-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"step-card\">\n                        <div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n                        <h3>Create Your Account</h3>\n                        <p>Enter your email address to initiate your StreamWave Monthly membership simulation.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"step-card\">\n                        <div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n                        <h3>Select Payment Method</h3>\n                        <p>Choose from EcoCash, Visa, or MasterCard simulated academic checkout options.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"step-card\">\n                        <div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n                        <h3>Start Streaming</h3>\n                        <p>Gain instant access to the member library with signed session authorization.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Supported Payment Methods Section -->\n        <section class=\"landing-section payment-methods-section\" aria-label=\"Supported Payment Methods\">\n            <div class=\"section-container text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"landing-section-title\">Supported Payment Simulation Methods</h2>\n                <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Convenient demonstration options tailored for Zimbabwe and international users</p>\n\n                <div class=\"payment-badges-row\">\n                    <div class=\"payment-badge ecocash-badge\">\n                        <span class=\"badge-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📱</span> EcoCash\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"payment-badge visa-badge\">\n                        <span class=\"badge-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">💳</span> Visa\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"payment-badge mastercard-badge\">\n                        <span class=\"badge-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">💳</span> MasterCard\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"notice-pill\">\n                    ⚠️ Academic Payment Simulation — No real money will be charged.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Notice -->\n    <footer class=\"app-footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"footer-logo-img\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"footer-disclaimer\">\n                <strong>Academic Serverless Prototype</strong> • Built with Python 3.12, FastAPI, and Vercel Serverless Functions.\n                This is a non-commercial academic demonstration for StreamWave Entertainment. Media titles are presented for Zimbabwean cultural demonstration purposes. Payment processing is simulated for assessment verification. No actual financial data or money is collected or transferred.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // Check active session on load\n        async function checkSession() {\n            try {\n                const res = await fetch('/api/session');\n                if (res.ok) {\n                    const data = await res.json();\n                    if (data.authenticated) {\n                        const btn = document.getElementById('nav-signin-btn');\n                        if (btn) {\n                            btn.textContent = 'Go to Library';\n                            btn.href = '/library';\n                        }\n                        const ctaBtn = document.getElementById('benefits-cta-btn');\n                        if (ctaBtn) {\n                            ctaBtn.textContent = 'Go to Member Library';\n                            ctaBtn.href = '/library';\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            } catch (e) {\n                console.warn('Session check error:', e);\n            }\n        }\n\n        function handleStartMembership(e) {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            const input = document.getElementById('landing-email-input');\n            const email = input ? input.value.trim() : '';\n            if (email) {\n                window.location.href = `/checkout?email=${encodeURIComponent(email)}`;\n            }\n        }\n\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', checkSession);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Update public/index.html with exact requested benefits copy, red-and-white inline SVG line icons, centered Call To Action block, and academic discreet note","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\public\\index.html","toolAction":"Updating public/index.html with refined Benefits section","toolSummary":"Updating public/index.html with refined Benefits section"}}]}
